1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:03,950
One small mistake can get your UK student visa refused.

2
00:00:04,400 --> 00:00:06,260
Here’s what you need to get right.

3
00:00:06,800 --> 00:00:09,690
One. Your CAS number, from your university.

4
00:00:10,200 --> 00:00:13,340
Two. Your living costs, held 28 days in a row.

5
00:00:13,800 --> 00:00:17,400
From 30 November: £1,570 a month in London.

6
00:00:17,500 --> 00:00:21,420
£1,203 outside London.

7
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:25,200
Three. The visa fee is £558,

8
00:00:25,300 --> 00:00:28,040
plus £776 a year for healthcare.

9
00:00:28,600 --> 00:00:30,900
Four. Apply up to 6 months before your course.

10
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:33,430
Decisions take about 3 weeks.

11
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:35,450
Now, the good part.

12
00:00:35,900 --> 00:00:40,010
Follow us and like this reel. We’ll file your student visa, for free.
